% A tune with w: lyrics has a conductor track that starts with the
% Soft-Karaoke header (GitHub issue #63).  This header, the tempo, the key
% signature and the time signature that follow it are at time 0, and the
% tempo change is on its bar line, as in a tune without lyrics.  They were
% all one tick later, so that a program reading the time signature at time
% 0 found none.
X:1
T:Tempo change with lyrics
C:abc2midi test
M:3/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
K:G
G A B |[Q:1/4=90] d2 z |]
w:one two three four
